---
title: Every Browser Should Come with Adblock
unlisted: true
---

In my estimation, the only possible reason a browser would not come with an adblocker, is because that browser is owned by a party which has interest in adspace.
Do not tell me it's because some may want to choose another adblocker: in this case the browser should have the user choose one during setup.

- uBlock is good
- Brave Shields is good
